### login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new_student",
  "email": "new_student@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### create club (replace {{token}})
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AI Club",
  "description": "Campus AI innovation club"
}

### list public activities
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### create manager activity
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/managers/me/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clubId": 1,
  "title": "Spring Recruitment",
  "description": "Recruitment open day",
  "location": "Building A",
  "startTime": "2030-04-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2030-04-01T10:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 100
}

### publish manager activity
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/managers/me/activities/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### register activity
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/activities/1/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
